The plate spans about 360 px, which I take as a 26 cm dinner plate (roughly 14 px per cm). The pizza slice is about 190 px long and 110 px wide, so roughly 13 cm by 8 cm. It is a thin, partly eaten slice with a crust edge. Its triangular shape gives an area of about 70 cm², and at about 1 cm thick that is roughly 70 cm³. Allowing for the airy crumb of the dough, I estimate about 50 g.

I counted the tomato sauce and cheese as part of the slice, and the basil leaf is tiny.

